    "description": "The Loyalty Transfer Management API enables businesses to facilitate the transfer of loyalty points among customers seamlessly and efficiently. By using this API, developers can implement loyalty programs that allow customers to share or transfer their rewards with others, enhancing customer engagement and satisfaction. This endpoint is particularly useful for customer service applications and loyalty program managers who seek to offer flexible options for point redemption and sharing. Typical consumers of this API include retail and hospitality businesses looking to leverage loyalty transfers to improve customer retention and drive sales.",
